    description: "WI-mafik Level 1b child (catastrophic — bumped to P3). `require \"json\"` + `JSON.parse(...)` emits ZERO calls edges. The Ruby analyzer does not recognize the require-then-call pattern at all on stdlib targets. Repro in polyglot fixture::ruby. Expected: calls edges whose dsts contain (`json` + `parse`), (`set` + `new`), (`json` + `generate`). Fix lives in packages/hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/src/hypergumbo_lang_mainstream/ruby.py — `require` tracking and namespaced-constant call resolution. Acceptance: remove xfail_reason for ruby in the polyglot fixture without other test changes."  # 4a11
